WEBVTT

00:12.780 --> 00:14.110
<b>Here is...</b>

00:28.340 --> 00:32.970
Final Episode

00:28.340 --> 00:32.970
Let's Walk Forth

00:38.140 --> 00:40.410
<b>Never Ever Land, huh?</b>

00:40.410 --> 00:42.850
<b>Wasn't it like ten years ago?</b>

00:42.850 --> 00:46.030
<b>It was really popular when it first opened.</b>

00:46.030 --> 00:50.790
<b>But soon after, the number of visitors dwindled and it went bust.</b>

00:50.790 --> 00:54.610
<b>Well, probably because of the mascot.</b>

00:55.130 --> 00:56.730
<b>Definitely.</b>

01:00.760 --> 01:02.620
<b>Hey, Ninomiya!</b>

01:04.280 --> 01:06.520
<b>Are you planning to go alone?</b>

01:06.520 --> 01:10.210
<b>Wait a second. Mayu is inside, right?
We're coming too!</b>

01:10.210 --> 01:11.180
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

01:28.970 --> 01:32.190
<b>So this is how it's like.</b>

01:33.500 --> 01:36.470
<b>Walking here like this.</b>

01:38.700 --> 01:41.910
<b>Then, when the monsters came out.</b>

01:41.910 --> 01:46.750
<b>And the prince would say,
"I shall be thy foe, foul being."</b>

01:58.190 --> 01:59.880
<b>Seems like fun.</b>

02:06.230 --> 02:07.850
<b>Back then...</b>

02:07.940 --> 02:08.730
<b>was so great!</b>

02:13.830 --> 02:18.270
<b>Why? Why did it end up this way?</b>

02:19.090 --> 02:21.240
<b>Because I'm a succubus...</b>

02:21.700 --> 02:25.670
<b>Or perhaps, it was because of my feelings towards Ninomiya-kun?</b>

02:27.160 --> 02:28.740
<b>Even though Reika-san was there.</b>

02:33.960 --> 02:35.420
<b>Thank god.</b>

02:36.700 --> 02:37.840
<b>So, you're really here.</b>

02:40.050 --> 02:41.220
<b>Wait!</b>

02:44.600 --> 02:47.030
<b>Wait. Please.</b>

02:53.480 --> 02:56.860
<b>Looks like everything has been left as it was.</b>

02:56.860 --> 02:59.060
<b>Everything is so run down.</b>

03:01.710 --> 03:03.070
<b>How did you know I was here?</b>

03:03.070 --> 03:04.410
<b>Eh?!</b>

03:04.410 --> 03:08.930
<b>By coming here, that means you've remember the past, right?</b>

03:09.390 --> 03:11.680
<b>Even then, why?</b>

03:11.680 --> 03:13.050
<b>That's because...</b>

03:17.170 --> 03:20.510
<b>I betrayed Reika-san.</b>

03:20.970 --> 03:26.260
<b>What's more, I took from you what you cannot regain.</b>

03:28.140 --> 03:31.520
<b>On the day you made that promise to Reika-san...</b>

03:32.470 --> 03:35.980
<b>I was honestly happy when I heard it.</b>

03:36.730 --> 03:37.650
<b>But...</b>

03:38.420 --> 03:43.490
<b>However, life became so lonely after Reika-san left.</b>

03:45.870 --> 03:51.210
<b>But in spite of that, you still treated me so kindly.</b>

04:07.760 --> 04:11.850
<b>I hid from you the fact that I'm a succubus.</b>

04:14.360 --> 04:20.360
<b>That was probably around the time when I started to fall in love with you.</b>

04:20.760 --> 04:22.730
<b>That's why I couldn't do it.</b>

04:22.730 --> 04:25.980
<b>I couldn't take your life force.</b>

04:25.980 --> 04:30.370
<b>I would be betraying Reika-san and myself.</b>

04:30.370 --> 04:36.860
<b>But, I thought that it'd be fine to receive a kiss from you after I died.</b>

04:36.860 --> 04:39.170
<b>That's what I thought when I was just a child.</b>

04:40.840 --> 04:42.800
<b>You mustn't, Mayu-chan.</b>

04:42.800 --> 04:46.230
<b>The doctor told you to rest.</b>

04:46.230 --> 04:49.660
<b>You worry too much, Shungo-kun.</b>

04:49.660 --> 04:52.640
<b>But, what's my Nee-san and your brother doing right now?</b>

04:53.180 --> 04:55.930
<b>I tried calling, but kept on getting the answering service.</b>

04:55.930 --> 04:57.670
<b>Hey, Shungo-kun...</b>

04:57.670 --> 04:58.520
<b>Listen.</b>

04:58.520 --> 04:59.390
<b>Huh!</b>

04:59.950 --> 05:01.030
<b>If...</b>

05:01.610 --> 05:05.670
<b>If I continue on sleeping...</b>

05:07.240 --> 05:09.280
<b>Long time no see.</b>

05:09.280 --> 05:10.620
<b>Reika-chan!</b>

05:11.710 --> 05:13.900
<b>What's wrong with you?</b>

05:13.900 --> 05:16.100
<b>Are you ill?</b>

05:17.100 --> 05:18.580
<b>A little.</b>

05:18.580 --> 05:21.630
<b>Then I guess we can't go today.</b>

05:22.500 --> 05:25.130
<b>Those are Never Ever Land tickets?</b>

05:25.130 --> 05:28.950
<b>Yeah, we made a promise to go together, right?</b>

05:28.950 --> 05:31.550
<b>So, we'll go some other time.</b>

05:31.550 --> 05:33.140
<b>I see.</b>

05:35.160 --> 05:38.520
<b>I'll be fine. So you two go ahead.</b>

05:39.970 --> 05:41.320
<b>But, that means...</b>

05:41.320 --> 05:43.690
<b>It's okay.</b>

05:43.690 --> 05:46.610
<b>Go! Hurry, hurry!</b>

05:51.400 --> 05:53.640
<b>We'll buy you some souvenirs.</b>

05:53.640 --> 05:55.740
<b>Make sure you get some rest.</b>

05:58.620 --> 06:01.000
<b>It's better this way.</b>

06:11.470 --> 06:12.890
<b>Mayu-chan...</b>

06:17.180 --> 06:18.880
<b>Oh no!</b>

06:18.880 --> 06:22.190
<b>I'm going to call for an ambulance!</b>

06:22.190 --> 06:27.070
Snow White

06:23.090 --> 06:25.830
<b>Hey, hey.</b>

06:25.830 --> 06:27.070
<b>Wake up.</b>

06:27.070 --> 06:31.320
<b>The princess will wake up with a kiss from the prince, right?</b>

06:34.380 --> 06:36.910
<b>Please...</b>

06:37.910 --> 06:39.540
<b>Open your eyes.</b>

06:46.140 --> 06:47.260
<b>Tsukimura-san!</b>

06:47.720 --> 06:50.510
<b>Your life force really is running out.</b>

06:56.970 --> 06:59.940
<b>But, I have to do it now.</b>

07:02.870 --> 07:04.840
<b>You mustn't.</b>

07:04.840 --> 07:06.320
<b>But then, you'll...</b>

07:06.320 --> 07:13.800
<b>Because Reika-san would be sad if you lost your memories again.</b>

07:13.800 --> 07:14.330
<b>Right.</b>

07:15.740 --> 07:21.500
<b>If that were to happen again,
my heart would be smashed to pieces.</b>

07:23.290 --> 07:26.930
<b>We still haven't had that important talk yet, have we, Mayu?</b>

07:27.570 --> 07:29.880
<b>Do you know what happened to Shungo after?</b>

07:32.510 --> 07:34.260
<b>Allow me to tell you then.</b>

07:35.160 --> 07:38.520
<b>About what happened there on that day.</b>

08:00.830 --> 08:03.100
<b>The ambulance will be here soon.</b>

08:06.120 --> 08:08.810
<b>Why are you with Shungo...</b>

08:15.450 --> 08:17.640
<b>Hang in there!</b>

08:17.640 --> 08:19.420
<b>Wake up.</b>

08:19.420 --> 08:24.040
<b>Wake up! Wake up, Ninomiya Shungo!</b>

08:32.740 --> 08:36.740
Snow White

08:40.050 --> 08:42.500
<b>This looks bad, Mikihiko. We're too late.</b>

08:42.500 --> 08:44.940
<b>Take Shungo-kun to the hospital quickly.</b>

08:44.940 --> 08:46.680
<b>I know.</b>

08:46.680 --> 08:48.380
<b>How did this happen?</b>

08:48.380 --> 08:53.770
<b>I trusted Mayu. Yet... Yet...</b>

08:56.140 --> 09:00.350
<b>That day, my heart split in two.</b>

09:00.350 --> 09:03.890
<b>Mayu seems to have locked her memories inside herself.</b>

09:03.890 --> 09:09.130
<b>Reika's succubus power manifested and created another self.</b>

09:09.130 --> 09:11.830
<b>Containing only anguished memories.</b>

09:11.830 --> 09:13.890
<b>And that would be you?</b>

09:15.080 --> 09:18.730
<b>So, who are you going to choose, Ninomiya Shungo?</b>

09:19.740 --> 09:22.260
<b>Are you going to keep your promise to Reika?</b>

09:22.260 --> 09:25.960
<b>Or are you prepared to lose
everything again to save Mayu?</b>

09:27.250 --> 09:32.770
<b>However, what you lose this time may not just be your memory.</b>

09:35.970 --> 09:38.220
<b>You're such a miserable person.</b>

09:39.390 --> 09:44.930
<b>The Houjou-senpai I know would never, ever abandon Tsukimura-san.</b>

09:44.930 --> 09:51.440
<b>Furthermore, Houjou-senpai would know what I have to do right now.</b>

09:56.100 --> 09:57.740
<b>Why?</b>

09:57.740 --> 10:00.740
<b>Why am I not good enough for you?</b>

10:00.740 --> 10:02.270
<b>Why?</b>

10:03.580 --> 10:06.750
<b>I've had enough of you!</b>

10:07.080 --> 10:08.580
<b>Hosaka!</b>

10:08.580 --> 10:10.750
<b>Are you serious, Ojou-sama?</b>

10:10.750 --> 10:13.660
<b>This is an order. Kill him now.</b>

10:13.660 --> 10:15.760
<b>I will not rescind that order.</b>

10:16.170 --> 10:19.010
<b>Just kill him!</b>

10:23.300 --> 10:25.090
<b>Ninomiya-kun!</b>

10:25.090 --> 10:27.230
<b>Please forgive me, Ninomiya-kun.</b>

10:27.230 --> 10:29.810
<b>This is an order from Ojou-sama.</b>

10:36.320 --> 10:37.820
<b>Stop!</b>

10:47.450 --> 10:49.230
<b>Is someone crying?</b>

10:58.840 --> 11:00.120
<b>Who are you?</b>

11:21.240 --> 11:22.700
<b>Tsukimura-san!</b>

11:28.470 --> 11:31.030
<b>You should be starting to realise that you cannot win.</b>

11:31.400 --> 11:33.330
<b>Hosaka-senpai, why?</b>

11:34.040 --> 11:37.340
<b>Ojou-sama is everything to me.</b>

11:37.750 --> 11:40.270
<b>I'm just trying to save Tsukimura-san.</b>

11:40.270 --> 11:43.380
<b>And you'll leave behind Ojou-sama who loves you so much?</b>

11:44.760 --> 11:46.890
<b>You remember everything now, don't you?</b>

11:47.350 --> 11:51.560
<b>Then why do you intend to repeat what happened ten years ago?</b>

11:51.560 --> 11:53.310
<b>I just don't understand.</b>

11:54.080 --> 11:55.650
<b>It's not the same.</b>

11:56.270 --> 11:59.150
<b>Now is our beginning.</b>

11:59.150 --> 12:00.480
<b>That's why.</b>

12:05.280 --> 12:07.990
<b>Please, make him stop.</b>

12:07.990 --> 12:10.750
<b>He's going to kill Ninomiya-kun.</b>

12:11.500 --> 12:13.690
<b>Please, Reika-san!</b>

12:19.140 --> 12:21.650
<b>Would you please stop crying?</b>

12:22.660 --> 12:25.400
<b>Nothing will come from crying.</b>

12:27.600 --> 12:32.120
<b>Oh enough! What are you crying about?</b>

12:32.120 --> 12:35.230
<b>I can't get what I want.</b>

12:35.230 --> 12:36.880
<b>Then steal it!</b>

12:36.880 --> 12:39.170
<b>But I can't do that either.</b>

12:39.170 --> 12:40.450
<b>Hopeless.</b>

12:40.450 --> 12:44.420
<b>I'll use any means possible to get what I want.</b>

12:46.160 --> 12:49.960
<b>Yes, to rescue Ninomiya Shungo from the clutches of evil...</b>

12:49.960 --> 12:53.200
<b>I ignored my position as the heiress to the Houjou Corporation</b>

12:53.200 --> 12:55.540
<b>and even became a maid.</b>

12:55.540 --> 12:59.170
<b>I'd do house chores everyday. I became skilled with the mop and cleaning windows.</b>

12:59.740 --> 13:05.550
<b>But, even so, I went through all that to steal Ninomiya Shungo from that air-headed, clumsy wench.</b>

13:06.830 --> 13:11.360
<b>That's why I even endured her doing that dirty woman's embarrassing training.</b>

13:11.360 --> 13:16.160
<b>I endured it when they made fun at
the fact that I didn't have any boobs.</b>

13:18.130 --> 13:21.190
<b>You sure say a lot of crazy things.</b>

13:22.290 --> 13:26.270
<b>But I know what it's like to live in that house.</b>

13:26.270 --> 13:28.410
<b>You had lots of fun, didn't you?</b>

13:29.650 --> 13:30.830
<b>You're...</b>

13:42.410 --> 13:43.510
<b>That's right.</b>

13:43.960 --> 13:45.200
<b>You're...</b>

13:46.510 --> 13:49.820
<b>were spawned from the weakness within myself.</b>

13:50.780 --> 13:52.740
<b>My other self.</b>

13:55.520 --> 13:57.000
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

13:57.000 --> 14:01.110
<b>I'm sorry for all I've put you through.</b>

14:01.570 --> 14:03.990
<b>I'm really sorry.</b>

14:31.680 --> 14:33.180
<b>Ninomiya-kun!</b>

14:46.660 --> 14:48.200
<b>Houjou-senpai!</b>

14:58.780 --> 15:01.750
<b>Why are you stiffening up, Ninomiya Shungo?</b>

15:01.750 --> 15:05.590
<b>This is because you're so hopeless.</b>

15:06.050 --> 15:09.480
<b>Put your back into it.</b>

15:10.090 --> 15:14.280
<b>Senpai, are you back to normal?</b>

15:14.280 --> 15:16.840
<b>Hosaka, that's enough.</b>

15:16.840 --> 15:17.810
<b>Please stop.</b>

15:18.440 --> 15:20.090
<b>No can do.</b>

15:20.090 --> 15:23.400
<b>I said that I will not rescind that order.</b>

15:24.020 --> 15:29.360
<b>Also, I only have your happiness in mind.</b>

15:29.360 --> 15:33.410
<b>Are you defying your master?</b>

15:36.640 --> 15:39.060
<b>What are you doing?</b>

15:39.700 --> 15:41.870
<b>Ninomiya Shungo, you...</b>

15:42.620 --> 15:44.140
<b>Tsukimura-san!</b>

15:45.460 --> 15:49.090
<b>Sorry, but can you wait a while longer?</b>

15:58.500 --> 16:02.710
<b>Ninomiya-kun, I can't any longer...</b>

16:03.440 --> 16:06.650
<b>Let's get it on, Ninomiya-kun.</b>

16:08.470 --> 16:09.490
<b>Right.</b>

16:25.620 --> 16:27.860
<b>Looks like I've been beaten.</b>

16:42.600 --> 16:44.730
<b>Tsukimura Mayu...</b>

16:44.730 --> 16:47.190
<b>Tsukimura-san. Why?</b>

16:49.990 --> 16:51.320
<b>Ninomiya-kun.</b>

16:51.940 --> 16:57.950
<b>This time, make sure you keep your promise with Reika-san.</b>

16:58.370 --> 16:59.960
<b>You must.</b>

17:11.210 --> 17:12.720
<b>How could this happen?</b>

17:15.050 --> 17:18.600
<b>Not yet. We still can save her.</b>

17:19.710 --> 17:21.040
<b>Are you going to...</b>

17:21.040 --> 17:23.600
<b>Forgive me, senpai. But I...</b>

17:23.600 --> 17:26.890
<b>Wait! What if you don't survive?!</b>

17:26.890 --> 17:29.040
<b>Stop.</b>

17:42.410 --> 17:47.010
<b>Why was Reika-san kissing me?</b>

17:48.620 --> 17:51.130
<b>Tsukimura-san, how are you feeling?</b>

17:54.510 --> 17:57.090
<b>I think I'm all right.</b>

17:57.090 --> 17:59.450
<b>What's wrong with you!</b>

17:59.450 --> 18:00.690
<b>You worried us so much!</b>

18:00.690 --> 18:03.570
<b>You too. You shouldn't kiss people so indiscriminately.</b>

18:03.570 --> 18:06.860
<b>I am a normal girl unlike you.</b>

18:06.860 --> 18:11.300
<b>That's because that dirty woman was taking advantage of me.</b>

18:11.300 --> 18:12.320
<b>I wonder about that.</b>

18:12.320 --> 18:17.930
<b>You were probably thinking: "This feels pretty good, Oh ho ho ho." Or something like that.</b>

18:17.930 --> 18:20.320
<b>What garbage are you saying?</b>

18:20.320 --> 18:26.110
<b>I see. Shungo-kun's life force was delivered to Mayu through Reika.</b>

18:26.110 --> 18:28.580
<b>I guess that's the theory.</b>

18:28.580 --> 18:31.460
<b>There were probably many heated debates about it.</b>

18:31.460 --> 18:33.750
<b>Well, I guess everything is back to normal now.</b>

18:34.440 --> 18:36.220
<b>Too good to be true.</b>

18:40.330 --> 18:42.210
<b>Okay, done here, Inoue.</b>

18:42.210 --> 18:43.260
<b>Okay!</b>

18:43.260 --> 18:45.390
<b>Switch, on!</b>

18:47.790 --> 18:50.400
<b>All right! A great success!</b>

18:51.630 --> 18:54.140
<b>We'd really be in trouble if we got caught.</b>

18:54.140 --> 18:57.400
<b>Well, sensei, this is self-restraint too.</b>

18:57.990 --> 19:00.910
<b>Mayu is still a girl despite how she seems.</b>

19:00.910 --> 19:03.980
<b>A trip to the theme park isn't complete without this.</b>

19:04.410 --> 19:06.990
<b>Ninomiya-kun, look.</b>

19:06.990 --> 19:09.370
<b>What's going on all of a sudden?</b>

19:09.370 --> 19:13.810
<b>That's odd. This place has been closed for quite a while already.</b>

19:14.360 --> 19:17.800
<b>Since we're here already, let's go have some fun then.</b>

19:17.800 --> 19:20.810
<b>Just like how we promised last time.</b>

19:20.810 --> 19:23.780
<b>Sheesh. Since you put it that way.</b>

19:23.780 --> 19:25.310
<b>That's right.</b>

19:25.310 --> 19:27.120
<b>Come on, hurry!</b>

19:27.120 --> 19:29.130
<b>Slow down, Tsukimura Mayu.</b>

19:29.540 --> 19:32.240
<b>Looks like we don't need to lend a hand.</b>

19:32.240 --> 19:34.560
<b>Well, as expected of Ninomiya.</b>

19:34.560 --> 19:41.020
<b>But if Ninomiya plans to start life anew, the other girls would probably have something to say about it.</b>

19:41.020 --> 19:43.070
<b>Well, it'll work out some how.</b>

19:43.070 --> 19:46.460
<b>As long as Ninomiya and those two can pass this hurdle.</b>

19:47.690 --> 19:50.070
<b>That was a pretty bad move... </b>

19:50.070 --> 19:53.040
<b>fighting Ninomiya when he's serious.</b>

19:54.080 --> 19:59.310
<b>But, I can't leave this filthy job to Shinobu.</b>

20:02.240 --> 20:05.210
<b>Talk to me next time.</b>

20:05.210 --> 20:07.770
<b>Believe and confide in me more.</b>

20:07.770 --> 20:08.890
<b>Got it?</b>

20:10.010 --> 20:12.140
<b>Yeah, you're right.</b>

20:12.890 --> 20:15.270
<b>Hey, don't grab onto me.</b>

20:15.270 --> 20:17.650
<b>But, I'm injured.</b>

20:17.650 --> 20:20.250
<b>No, get away from me.</b>

20:20.250 --> 20:23.000
<b>Come on, don't say that.</b>

20:30.310 --> 20:33.210
<b>Tsukimura-san, you're overdoing it.</b>

20:33.830 --> 20:36.120
<b>No problem. I can still go on.</b>

20:36.120 --> 20:39.760
<b>My self-control won't last much longer.</b>

20:39.760 --> 20:44.760
<b>But this is training. Ninomiya-kun, please answer quickly.</b>

20:44.160 --> 20:50.030
Our first meeting was
on a starry night.

20:44.760 --> 20:48.760
<b>How the hell do I know what you're writing with your boobs?!</b>

20:49.750 --> 20:51.350
<b>Would you stop this?</b>

20:50.030 --> 20:57.520
I was the one who spoke to
you first, do you remember?

20:51.350 --> 20:56.010
<b>Seriously. You two have to stop this immoral relationship.</b>

20:57.520 --> 21:00.540
<b>Then, let's kill him, right this moment.</b>

21:00.540 --> 21:02.530
<b>Like I was saying...</b>

21:01.570 --> 21:07.800
Even if you make a wish,

21:02.530 --> 21:05.480
<b>You do the same routine all the time.</b>

21:05.480 --> 21:08.360
<b>This training produces no results.</b>

21:07.800 --> 21:10.290
Happily and perfectly,

21:08.360 --> 21:10.290
<b>That's not true.</b>

21:10.290 --> 21:16.150
you can change any world.

21:10.290 --> 21:12.560
<b>This is the human spirit!</b>

21:12.560 --> 21:14.750
<b>Dreams will come true if you don't give up.</b>

21:15.270 --> 21:19.800
<b>By the way, Ninomiya-kun. The fish you were cooking for breakfast is burnt.</b>

21:18.190 --> 21:22.460
Hey darlin', let's make a pinky promise.

21:20.250 --> 21:22.760
<b>Looks like we're having cinders for breakfast.</b>

21:22.460 --> 21:25.300
No lies, OK?

21:22.760 --> 21:25.300
<b>I've decided on a punishment for everyone.</b>

21:25.300 --> 21:31.100
Because I'll always be watching
you, today and tomorrow too.

21:25.300 --> 21:27.190
<b>Oh crap!</b>

